There's a ship for every playstyle. And when you have mastered one, reach perfection by getting its ultimate <strong>Apex Forms</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/steam_campaign-min.gif?t=1742309360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through <strong>30 story missions</strong> that push you to the edge. Explore the far reaches of space, face unyielding enemy waves, and take down screen-filling bosses as you fight back against the Invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/steam_leaderboard-min.gif?t=1742309360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the campaign, <strong>new challenges drop every single day</strong>\u2014identical for every pilot worldwide. Choose your favourite ship, show your mastery of its abilities, and <strong>rise on the leaderboards</strong>. It\u2019s you against everyone else. In these <strong>global rankings</strong>, every fraction of a second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678070/extras/steam_evolving_maxium_fps.gif?t=1742309360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running on <strong>our handcrafted game engine</strong>, Phoenix 2 delivers ultra-fluid action with seamless cross-platform play. Run at the <strong>maximum FPS</strong> your system can deliver for ultra-fluid action and incredibly responsive controls. Play with <strong>mouse, keyboard, or gamepad</strong>, whichever suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The galaxy won\u2019t save itself. Are you ready to take flight?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Firi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descriptio